Girls Just Want to Have Fun is a comedy, family,
music film directed by Alan Metter.

3
00:11:51,818 --> 00:11:57,818
Janey is new in town.

4
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:55,090
She soon meets Lynne, a classmate who shares her
passion for the local show 'Dance TV'.

5
00:19:46,363 --> 00:19:52,363
When a competition is announced to find new Dance TV
performers, Janey and Lynne are determined to audition.

