13
00:51:24,545 --> 00:51:30,545
Girls Just Want to Have Fun is a 1985 American romantic comedy dance film
directed by Alan Metter and distributed by New World Pictures.

14
00:55:21,818 --> 00:55:27,818
It was written by Amy Spies and stars Sarah Jessica Parker, Lee Montgomery,
Morgan Woodward, Jonathan Silverman, Shannen Doherty, and Helen Hunt.

15
00:59:19,090 --> 00:59:25,090
Its story follows Janey, a new girl in town who meets Lynne and discovers
they both share a passion for dancing and the TV show Dance TV.

16
01:03:16,363 --> 01:03:22,363
Together the two enter a competition to be a new Dance TV regular
couple; however, Janey's father does not approve.

17
01:07:13,636 --> 01:07:19,636
The film was produced by Chuck Russell and was released on April 12, 1985.

18
01:11:10,909 --> 01:11:16,909
It grossed $1.7 million in its opening weekend and $6.3
million worldwide, against a budget of $5 million.

19
01:15:08,181 --> 01:15:14,181
Despite this, the film was regularly aired on cable TV for
several years and has become a cult film.

20
01:19:05,454 --> 01:19:11,454
The film explores themes of chicago, illinois,
dancing, dance competition, catholic school.

21
01:23:02,727 --> 01:23:08,727
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
